NodeCast for iPhone — Expo edition
Initial mobile implementation: 2026-10-23.

Inspired by NodeCast TV:
https://github.com/technomancer702/nodecast-tv
Upstream license: GNU GPL version 3 only.
The first prototype adapted the upstream dark/indigo design palette.
The 0.2.0 interface uses an independent light iOS-style layout and mint palette.
This version implements a new React Native interface, provider client, M3U parser,
secure storage, and Expo player; it does not embed the upstream Node.js server.

